## Troubleshooting

**Marquez not starting?**
```bash
docker compose -f ops/marquez/docker-compose.yml logs marquez
```

**Quality checks failing unexpectedly?**
- Verify your data format matches the schema
- Check for hidden characters in CSV files
- Ensure numeric fields don't contain strings

**Lineage events not appearing?**
- Verify `OPENLINEAGE_URL` is accessible
- Check Marquez logs for ingestion errors
- Ensure namespace matches between emission and UI

**Need help?** Join our [Discord community](https://discord.gg/flowforge) or check the [FAQ](../faq.md).